# Pangolin (pang11) -----------------------------------------------

The Pang11 is a System76 laptop, released in March of 2021, and
supports AMD's Ryzen 5 5500U and Ryzen 7 5700U APUs. 

The following files have been sourced / archived from:
github.com/system76/tech-docs/blob/master/src/models/pang11
	- OEM-tech-docs/pang11.tar.gz
